<title>FRANCE: Usinor Sacilor posts 16 bln Ffr Q3 sales.</title>
<headline>Usinor Sacilor posts 16 bln Ffr Q3 sales.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 16,009     18,087</p>
<p>- of which</p>
<p>    Flat products			   8,145	9,293</p>
<p>    Stainless steel and alloys	  3,631	4,491</p>
<p>    Special steels			  2,852	3,469</p>
<p>    Other businesses			1,971	1,846</p>
<p>    Sales of assets within the group    590	1,012</p>
<p>NOTE - Usinor Sacilor SA gave the results in a statement. It said the 10.4 percent drop in turnover in the third quarter 1996 from a year ago was due to a drop in sales volume and prices.</p>
<p>Cumulative turnover for the first nine months of 1996 was 53.4 billion francs, down 9.8 percent from the same period last year. Fourth turnover is expected to show a better performance than the first nine months, the company added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
